It is just a demo and not full-fledged telnet client.
It is a little bit more complex than Echo server made 
for demonstrating how to built any protocol
multi-threaded server using the framework on the lower layer than Messages (direct access
to Input/Output streams). 

For running the example:

1.cd to the example directory;
2.start runServer.sh under Unix or runServer.bat under Win
3.start runClient.sh under Unix or runClient.bat under Win

